---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout 
  title="肝臟 Couinaud 8分段 3D 互動解剖系統 | 互動解剖圖鑑 - 黃冠智醫師" 
  description="Couinaud 肝臟 8 分段高擬真 3D 實體解剖系統。包含 360 度空間旋轉、3 條縱向肝靜脈、橫向門靜脈樹與超音波掃描切面指引。"
  fullWidth={true}
  hideFooter={true}
>
  <!-- Three.js CDN dependencies -->
  <script is:inline src="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/three.js/r128/three.min.js"></script>
  <script is:inline src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/three@0.128.0/examples/js/controls/OrbitControls.js"></script>
  <script is:inline src="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/tween.js/18.6.4/tween.umd.js"></script>

  <div class="liver-app-wrapper" id="liverAppWrapper">
    <!-- Subheader with breadcrumb & action controls -->
    <div class="anatomy-subnav">
      <div class="subnav-left">
        <a href="/anatomy" class="back-link">
          <svg width="15" height="15" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M19 12H5M12 19l-7-7 7-7"/></svg>
          <span>圖鑑總覽</span>
        </a>
        <div class="divider">/</div>
        <div class="current-badge">
          <span class="pulse-dot"></span>
          <span>肝臟 (Couinaud 8分段 3D 模型)</span>
        </div>
      </div>
      
      <div class="subnav-right">
        <!-- Fullscreen Button -->
        <button class="btn btn-fullscreen" id="btn-fullscreen-toggle" onclick="toggleFullScreen()" title="進入/退出全螢幕診間衛教模式">
          <svg width="14" height="14" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" viewBox="0 0 24 24" id="icon-fs"><path d="M8 3H5a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v3m18 0V5a2 2 0 0 0-2-2h-3m0 18h3a2 2 0 0 0 2-2v-3M3 16v3a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h3"/></svg>
          <span class="btn-text-full">全螢幕</span>
        </button>
        <button class="btn btn-outline" id="btn-toggle-quiz" onclick="toggleQuizMode()">
          <svg width="14" height="14" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M9 11l3 3L22 4"/><path d="M21 12v7a2 2 0 01-2 2H5a2 2 0 01-2-2V5a2 2 0 012-2h11"/></svg>
          <span class="btn-text-full">3D 測驗</span>
        </button>
        <button class="btn btn-primary" onclick="reset3DCamera()">
          <svg width="14" height="14" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M3 12a9 9 0 1 0 9-9 9.75 9.75 0 0 0-6.74 2.74L3 8"/><path d="M3 3v5h5"/></svg>
          <span>重設</span>
        </button>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Main 3-Column Workspace Grid (Edge-to-edge full width) -->
    <div class="workspace-grid">

      <!-- Mobile Tab Switcher Navigation -->
      <div class="mobile-tabs-nav">
        <button class="mobile-tab-btn active" id="tab-btn-regions" onclick="switchMobileTab('regions')">
          📍 8大分段 (S1~S8)
        </button>
        <button class="mobile-tab-btn" id="tab-btn-details" onclick="switchMobileTab('details')">
          📋 超音波報告片語
        </button>
      </div>

      <!-- Left Panel: 3D Sliders, Toggles & Structure List (Column 1 on Desktop) -->
      <div class="glass-panel left-panel mobile-tab-pane" id="pane-regions-pathology">
        <div class="panel-header">
          <div class="panel-title">
            <svg width="16" height="16" fill="none" stroke="#38bdf8" stroke-width="2" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M12 20v-6M6 20V10M18 20V4"/></svg>
            3D 控制與分段選擇
          </div>
        </div>
        
        <div class="panel-body">
          
          <!-- Explanatory Principle Box -->
          <div class="concept-box">
            <div class="concept-title">
              <svg width="14" height="14" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"/><line x1="12" y1="16" x2="12" y2="12"/><line x1="12" y1="8" x2="12.01" y2="8"/></svg>
              3D 血管與分段標準
            </div>
            <div>
              1. <strong>3 條縱向肝靜脈 (R, M, L)</strong>：縱行於 3 條葉間裂，將肝臟劃分為右後、右前、左內、左外 4 個扇區。<br>
              2. <strong>橫向門脈系統 (PV)</strong>：由門靜脈主幹進入，水平分支將各扇區切分為<strong>上段 (7, 8, 4a, 2)</strong> 與 <strong>下段 (6, 5, 4b, 3)</strong>。
            </div>
          </div>

          <!-- Tissue Opacity Slider -->
          <div class="control-row">
            <div class="control-label-group">
              <span>肝實質透明度 (Tissue Opacity)</span>
              <span id="txt-opacity-val" class="slider-val">88%</span>
            </div>
            <input type="range" id="slider-opacity" min="15" max="100" value="88" oninput="onOpacitySlider(this.value)">
            <div class="slider-subtext-single">
              調低透明度可透視內部 3D 門脈與肝靜脈血管網絡
            </div>
          </div>

          <!-- Segment List -->
          <div class="section-label">
            點選肝分段 (SEGMENTS)
          </div>
          <div class="segment-grid-list">
            <div class="seg-card-btn" onclick="selectSegment('s1')" id="btn-seg-s1">
              <div class="seg-card-top">
                <span class="seg-num-pill">S1</span>
                <span class="seg-loc-tag">尾狀葉/IVC旁</span>
              </div>
              <div class="seg-card-name">尾狀葉 (Caudate)</div>
            </div>

            <div class="seg-card-btn" onclick="selectSegment('s2')" id="btn-seg-s2">
              <div class="seg-card-top">
                <span class="seg-num-pill">S2</span>
                <span class="seg-loc-tag">左外上段</span>
              </div>
              <div class="seg-card-name">左外側上段 (L. Lat Sup)</div>
            </div>

            <div class="seg-card-btn" onclick="selectSegment('s3')" id="btn-seg-s3">
              <div class="seg-card-top">
                <span class="seg-num-pill">S3</span>
                <span class="seg-loc-tag">左外下段</span>
              </div>
              <div class="seg-card-name">左外側下段 (L. Lat Inf)</div>
            </div>

            <div class="seg-card-btn" onclick="selectSegment('s4')" id="btn-seg-s4">
              <div class="seg-card-top">
                <span class="seg-num-pill">S4</span>
                <span class="seg-loc-tag">左內側段 (4a/4b)</span>
              </div>
              <div class="seg-card-name">左內側段 / 方葉</div>
            </div>

            <div class="seg-card-btn" onclick="selectSegment('s5')" id="btn-seg-s5">
              <div class="seg-card-top">
                <span class="seg-num-pill">S5</span>
                <span class="seg-loc-tag">右前下段</span>
              </div>
              <div class="seg-card-name">右前下段 (R. Ant Inf)</div>
            </div>

            <div class="seg-card-btn" onclick="selectSegment('s6')" id="btn-seg-s6">
              <div class="seg-card-top">
                <span class="seg-num-pill">S6</span>
                <span class="seg-loc-tag">右後下段</span>
              </div>
              <div class="seg-card-name">右後下段 (R. Post Inf)</div>
            </div>

            <div class="seg-card-btn" onclick="selectSegment('s7')" id="btn-seg-s7">
              <div class="seg-card-top">
                <span class="seg-num-pill">S7</span>
                <span class="seg-loc-tag">右後上段</span>
              </div>
              <div class="seg-card-name">右後上段 (R. Post Sup)</div>
            </div>

            <div class="seg-card-btn" onclick="selectSegment('s8')" id="btn-seg-s8">
              <div class="seg-card-top">
                <span class="seg-num-pill">S8</span>
                <span class="seg-loc-tag">右前上段</span>
              </div>
              <div class="seg-card-name">右前上段 (R. Ant Sup)</div>
            </div>
          </div>

          <!-- 3D Vessel Layer Toggles -->
          <div class="vessel-toggles">
            <button class="btn btn-vessel active" id="btn-toggle-pv" onclick="toggleVesselLayer('pv')">
              門脈系統 (洋紅紫)
            </button>
            <button class="btn btn-vessel active" id="btn-toggle-hv" onclick="toggleVesselLayer('hv')">
              肝靜脈系統 (深藍)
            </button>
          </div>

        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Center Stage: Three.js True 3D Solid WebGL Canvas (Column 2 on Desktop) -->
      <div class="glass-panel canvas-panel">
        <!-- Preset View Angles Toolbar -->
        <div class="view-angles-toolbar">
          <button class="view-btn active" id="view-btn-anterior" onclick="setPresetView('anterior')">正面觀</button>
          <button class="view-btn" id="view-btn-visceral" onclick="setPresetView('visceral')">臟面後觀</button>
          <button class="view-btn" id="view-btn-right-lat" onclick="setPresetView('right_lat')">右後側視角</button>
          <button class="view-btn" id="view-btn-left-lat" onclick="setPresetView('left_lat')">左側薄楔角</button>
          <button class="view-btn" id="view-btn-superior" onclick="setPresetView('superior')">橫膈俯視</button>
          <button class="view-btn" id="view-btn-subcostal" onclick="setPresetView('subcostal')">肋下切面</button>
        </div>

        <!-- ThreeJS Canvas Container -->
        <div id="threejs-canvas-container"></div>

        <!-- Orbit Controls Guidance Hint (Top Right) -->
        <div class="orbit-hint hide-mobile">
          <svg width="15" height="15" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"/><path d="M12 8v8M8 12h8"/></svg>
          <span><strong>滑鼠左鍵拖曳</strong>：360° 真 3D 空間旋轉 ｜ <strong>滾輪</strong>：拉近縮放 ｜ <strong>點擊 3D 塊體</strong>：高亮解剖</span>
        </div>

        <!-- Explode Control Bar (Embedded at Bottom of Center 3D Stage on Desktop & Mobile) -->
        <div class="canvas-explode-bar">
          <div class="control-row" style="margin-bottom: 0;">
            <div class="control-label-group">
              <span style="color: #38bdf8; font-weight: 800;">3D 炸開程度 (Explosion)</span>
              <span id="txt-explode-val" class="slider-val">30%</span>
            </div>
            <input type="range" id="slider-explode" min="0" max="100" value="30" oninput="onExplodeSlider(this.value)">
            <div class="slider-subtext">
              <span>0% (緊密天然形狀)</span>
              <span>100% (完全炸開)</span>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Right Panel: Clinical Information & Ultrasound Guide (Column 3 on Desktop) -->
      <div class="glass-panel right-panel mobile-tab-pane" id="pane-clinical-details">
        <div class="panel-header">
          <div class="panel-title">
            <svg width="16" height="16" fill="none" stroke="#10b981" stroke-width="2" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M14 2H6a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v16a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h12a2 2 0 0 0 2-2V8z"/><polyline points="14 2 14 8 20 8"/><line x1="16" y1="13" x2="8" y2="13"/><line x1="16" y1="17" x2="8" y2="17"/><polyline points="10 9 9 9 8 9"/></svg>
            臨床判讀與超音波指引
          </div>
        </div>
        
        <div class="panel-body" id="detail-panel">
          
          <!-- Header Title Info -->
          <div class="detail-title-group">
            <div style="display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 0.45rem; margin-bottom: 0.3rem;">
              <span id="det-pill" class="seg-badge-pill">Segment 6</span>
              <span id="det-sector" class="sector-tag">Right Posterior Sector (Inferior)</span>
            </div>
            <div id="det-title-zh" class="main-title">Segment 6 (右後下段)</div>
            <div id="det-title-en" class="sub-title">Right Posterior Inferior Segment (Segmentum posterius inferius)</div>
          </div>

          <!-- Metric Grid -->
          <div class="metric-grid">
            <div class="metric-box">
              <div class="metric-label">門脈分支 (橫向供血)</div>
              <div id="det-vessel-in" class="metric-value">門靜脈右後下支 (P6)</div>
            </div>
            <div class="metric-box">
              <div class="metric-label">引流肝靜脈 (縱向回流)</div>
              <div id="det-vessel-out" class="metric-value">右肝靜脈 (RHV)</div>
            </div>
            <div class="metric-box">
              <div class="metric-label">解剖扇形區 (Sector)</div>
              <div id="det-sector-name" class="metric-value">右後側扇區 (下段)</div>
            </div>
            <div class="metric-box">
              <div class="metric-label">超音波標準掃描切面</div>
              <div id="det-us-view" class="metric-value">右第 8~10 肋間 / 腎肝切面</div>
            </div>
          </div>

          <!-- Surgical Pearls -->
          <div class="surgical-pearls" id="det-surgical-box">
            <strong>外科解剖要點：</strong> 位於右葉下半部後側。與 S7 共同構成右後葉，以門靜脈右後支之水平分叉平面與 S7 分界。
          </div>

          <!-- Ultrasound Clinical Pearls -->
          <div class="detail-card">
            <h3>
              <svg width="14" height="14" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M12 2v20M17 5H9.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 0 0 7h5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1 0 7H6"/></svg>
              超音波判讀與臨床指引 (Clinical Pearls)
            </h3>
            <div id="det-pearls-list">
              <div class="pearl-item">
                <svg width="14" height="14" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 20 20"><path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M10 18a8 8 0 100-16 8 8 0 000 16zm3.707-9.293a1 1 0 00-1.414-1.414L9 10.586 7.707 9.293a1 1 0 00-1.414 1.414l2 2a1 1 0 001.414 0l4-4z" clip-rule="evenodd"/></svg>
                <span><strong>莫里森氏囊 (Morison's Pouch)</strong>：S6 與右腎實質交界處為腹膜腔最低點，創傷或腹水超音波（FAST）的首要探查點。</span>
              </div>
              <div class="pearl-item">
                <svg width="14" height="14" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 20 20"><path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M10 18a8 8 0 100-16 8 8 0 000 16zm3.707-9.293a1 1 0 00-1.414-1.414L9 10.586 7.707 9.293a1 1 0 00-1.414 1.414l2 2a1 1 0 001.414 0l4-4z" clip-rule="evenodd"/></svg>
                <span><strong>脂肪肝對比指標</strong>：常以此區域與右腎皮質（Cortex）進行回音強度對比，評估脂肪肝嚴重程度。</span>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>

          <!-- Automatic Medical Phrase Generator -->
          <div class="phrase-box">
            <div class="phrase-header">
              <span class="phrase-title">超音波 / 臨床病歷報告片語 (點擊即複製)</span>
              <button class="btn btn-outline" style="padding: 0.18rem 0.5rem; font-size: 0.68rem;" onclick="copyPhrase()">複製片語</button>
            </div>
            <div id="det-phrase-text" class="phrase-content">
              Abdominal Echo: A well-defined hyperechoic nodule (approx. cm) noted at Segment 6 (S6), favor Hemangioma.
            </div>
          </div>

        </div>
      </div>

    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- Toast Notification -->
  <div id="toast">
    <svg width="18" height="18" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M20 6L9 17l-5-5"/></svg>
    <span id="toast-msg">已複製片語至剪貼簿！</span>
  </div>

  <script is:inline>
    // Couinaud Anatomical Knowledge Database
    const couinaudData = {
      s1: {
        roman: 'I',
        arabic: '1',
        titleZh: 'Segment 1 (尾狀葉 / Caudate Lobe)',
        titleEn: 'Caudate Lobe (Lobus caudatus)',
        sector: 'Independent Dorsal Sector',
        vesselIn: '門靜脈左右主幹直接發出之微小分支 (P1)',
        vesselOut: '直接匯入下腔靜脈 (IVC) 短肝靜脈，不經三條主肝靜脈',
        sectorName: '背側獨立扇區 (Dorsal)',
        usView: '劍突下橫切/斜切面，夾在 IVC 與門靜脈左支橫部之間',
        surgical: '<strong>外科重要性</strong>：因具備獨立血管出入迴路，在布加症候群 (Budd-Chiari syndrome) 或肝硬化時常呈代償性肥大；位置深在第一與第二肝門之間，手術切除難度極高。',
        pearls: [
          '<strong>超音波地標</strong>：前方以「靜脈韌帶裂 (Fissure for ligamentum venosum)」與左葉分界，後方直接貼附下腔靜脈 (IVC)。',
          '<strong>代償性肥大比值</strong>：Caudate / Right lobe 寬度比值 > 0.65 為診斷肝硬化之特異性超音波指標。'
        ],
        phrase: 'Liver Echo: Caudate lobe (S1) is normal in size without focal lesion. Short hepatic veins to IVC are patent.'
      },
      s2: {
        roman: 'II',
        arabic: '2',
        titleZh: 'Segment 2 (左外側上段 / Left Lateral Superior)',
        titleEn: 'Left Lateral Superior Segment',
        sector: 'Left Lateral Sector (Superior)',
        vesselIn: '門靜脈左外側上支 (P2)',
        vesselOut: '左肝靜脈 (LHV)',
        sectorName: '左外側扇區 (上段)',
        usView: '劍突下向左上橫膈穹窿仰角切面',
        surgical: '<strong>外科重要性</strong>：與 S3 共同構成左外側葉 (Left Lateral Section)。左外側葉切除術 (Left lateral sectionectomy, S2+S3) 為活體肝移植供體或左葉良惡性腫瘤之經典術式。',
        pearls: [
          '<strong>解剖高位</strong>：緊貼橫膈左穹隆與心包膜下方，超音波檢查時需請受檢者深吸氣以降低肝臟位置。',
          '<strong>腫瘤熱消融 (RFA) 注意</strong>：鄰近胃壁賁門與心臟，施行消融需注意熱傳導風險。'
        ],
        phrase: 'Liver Echo: Segment 2 (S2) shows smooth surface and homogeneous parenchymal echogenicity.'
      },
      s3: {
        roman: 'III',
        arabic: '3',
        titleZh: 'Segment 3 (左外側下段 / Left Lateral Inferior)',
        titleEn: 'Left Lateral Inferior Segment',
        sector: 'Left Lateral Sector (Inferior)',
        vesselIn: '門靜脈左外側下支 (P3)',
        vesselOut: '左肝靜脈 (LHV)',
        sectorName: '左外側扇區 (下段)',
        usView: '劍突下縱切與橫切面 (腹主動脈前方透聲窗)',
        surgical: '<strong>外科重要性</strong>：位置最表淺且易於探查。以門脈左支水平部之分支平面與 S2 分隔。',
        pearls: [
          '<strong>肝硬化外觀評估首選</strong>：表淺且緊鄰腹壁，為評估肝臟包膜平整度（Liver surface nodularity）的最佳區域。',
          '<strong>超音波尖銳角</strong>：正常左葉下緣邊界銳利（角度 < 45度），若變鈍常提示肝腫大或實質纖維化。'
        ],
        phrase: 'Liver Echo: Sharp inferior margin at Segment 3 (S3). No superficial nodularity or focal mass.'
      },
      s4: {
        roman: 'IV',
        arabic: '4',
        titleZh: 'Segment 4 (左內側段 / 含 4a 及 4b 方葉)',
        titleEn: 'Left Medial Segment (Quadrate / Medial)',
        sector: 'Left Medial Sector (IVa + IVb)',
        vesselIn: '門靜脈左支矢狀部發出之 P4 支',
        vesselOut: '中肝靜脈 (MHV) 及 左肝靜脈 (LHV)',
        sectorName: '左內側扇區 (Medial Sector)',
        usView: '右肋緣下橫切面 (膽囊窩與鐮狀韌帶之間)',
        surgical: '<strong>外科重要性</strong>：左界為鐮狀韌帶，右界為主門裂 (Cantlie Line / 中肝靜脈)。下半部即為解剖學方葉 (Quadrate Lobe)。',
        pearls: [
          '<strong>局部脂肪避開區好發 (Focal Fatty Sparing)</strong>：因胃冠狀靜脈或膽囊旁靜脈血流直接引入，在脂肪肝背景下極常出現邊界分明的「低回音假腫瘤」。',
          '<strong>膽囊癌侵犯</strong>：膽囊床之腫瘤最常直接浸潤侵犯 S4 與 S5。'
        ],
        phrase: 'Liver Echo: Segment 4 (S4) parenchyma is homogeneous; no focal mass at gallbladder bed.'
      },
      s5: {
        roman: 'V',
        arabic: '5',
        titleZh: 'Segment 5 (右前下段 / Right Anterior Inferior)',
        titleEn: 'Right Anterior Inferior Segment',
        sector: 'Right Anterior Sector (Inferior)',
        vesselIn: '門靜脈右前下支 (P5)',
        vesselOut: '右肝靜脈 (RHV) 與 中肝靜脈 (MHV)',
